  "scope_and_limitations": [
    "RT-DETR FAM standard is an existing complete five-seed Stage A control reused without duplicate training. Common model/training/data configuration and reconstructed initialization hashes were checked in notes/stage_a_five_seed_v2_results.md; its original source/runtime snapshot is not guaranteed identical to the new ablations.",
    "The mixed-consistency student path consumes additional random draws; seed pairing does not guarantee identical subsequent Modal Dropout realizations. The comparison estimates the full training intervention.",
    "YOLO26 best metrics are live EMA selection values; serialized-best replay is a separate integrity check. Latest metrics have the precision of results.csv.",
    "RT-DETRv2 metrics are live validation history values. Completion, saved-artifact presence, common configuration/runtime, detection-head initialization, transfer metadata and traced inputs are verified. Whole-model initial hashes differ because Additive omits FAM modules. No fresh inference replay or strict checkpoint tensor load was performed for this export.",
    "New five-seed masked-IR/native-IR mixed-consistency evaluation and box-guided geometric/active-versus-zero audits were not performed. Their outcomes are not inferred from single-seed diagnostics. All necessary primary performance gates already fail.",
    "Cross-family absolute mAP values are descriptive, not a controlled model ranking: recipes, budgets and evaluation pipelines differ. Stage A validation values are not interchangeable with Stage B MtErie values.",
    "No new training or dataset inference was executed to create these portable summary artifacts."
  ]
